{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/5fe734702986782788ee61ac485f65ac.avif?t=1759947749\" width=600 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona is a first-person psychological horror set in the 1970s. A claustrophobic journey between light and darkness, truth and hallucination.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/e27c0c535245c172d5927da8fa3a242a.avif?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samuel</strong> is a young journalist tasked with interviewing Ramona, a mysterious former babysitter involved in a tragic crime story. But once he enters her apartment, he discovers that Ramona has vanished... or perhaps she never truly left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/aca7d91b50c60c43154740c21975d0e6.avif?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/f6705e282df884b7ec563d90fd0652a0.webp?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through an old camera and a series of rules to follow, Samuel delves into a house that is alive, restless, haunted by <strong>remorse and buried memories</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/af29f131dc6a6fd6d8b0eb28e6b43a6b.avif?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photographs in the dark to reveal what the human eye cannot see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/be48b0032e07113318799df7527d2a68.avif?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not turn on radios, do not move objects, do not break the rules. Or Ramona will awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/7b24d802c5fee82646a60319023edd0c.avif?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and collect documents to uncover the truth about Ramona.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/e53da7313e00d76bddccb96b15dec146.avif?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has a story. Every photograph hides a secret.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ramona is an intense narrative experience, where every choice, every noise, and every silence can change your fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/7443813feadc9f639cd3105dc701d6cb.webp?t=1759947749\" width=615 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 A camera as your only weapon against the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 A system of rules to follow in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Environmental storytelling through letters, diaries, and photographs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Unique puzzles integrated into the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Original soundtrack inspired by the 1970s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ramona is not just any ghost. She is the reflection of your guilt. It\u2019s up to you to decide whether to face it\u2026 or run away once again.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863340?t=1759947749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/1a4a8ad618d1423b165c85588bce39ceb584e1b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759947749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/3a8e9d6d8fe285597e37697c266f830558d28bab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759947749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/3a8e9d6d8fe285597e37697c266f830558d28bab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759947749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game deals with themes related to the abuse of children during their childhood."},"demos":[{"appid":4044700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863340/extras/5fe734702986782788ee61ac485f65ac.avif?t=1759947749\" widt